msgstr "Qiskit Addons"

#. type: Title #
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Qiskit Addons {#qiskit-addons}"
msgstr "Qiskit Addons {#qiskit-addons}"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"[Qiskit Addons](https://github.com/Qiskit?q=qiskit-addon) are official "
"extension packages that provide specialized quantum computing algorithms and"
" techniques. Each addon focuses on a specific area and includes tutorials "
"with executable code.\n"
msgstr ""
"[Qiskit Addons](https://github.com/Qiskit?q=qiskit-addon) to oficjalne "
"pakiety rozszerzeń oferujące wyspecjalizowane algorytmy i techniki obliczeń "
"kwantowych. Każdy addon skupia się na konkretnym obszarze i zawiera "
"samouczki z wykonywalnym kodem.\n"

#. type: Title ##
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Available Addons {#available-addons}"
msgstr "Dostępne Addons {#available-addons}"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"| Addon | Package | Description |\n"
"|-------|---------|-------------|\n"
"| **Circuit Cutting** | `qiskit-addon-cutting` | Reduce circuit width and depth by cutting gates and wires |\n"
"| **SQD** | `qiskit-addon-sqd` | Sample-based Quantum Diagonalization for ground state estimation |\n"
"| **OBP** | `qiskit-addon-obp` | Operator Back-Propagation to reduce circuit depth |\n"
"| **MPF** | `qiskit-addon-mpf` | Multi-Product Formulas for improved Hamiltonian simulation |\n"
"| **AQC-Tensor** | `qiskit-addon-aqc-tensor` | Approximate Quantum Compilation with tensor networks |\n"
"| **PNA** | `qiskit-addon-pna` | Propagated Noise Absorption for error mitigation |\n"
"| **SLC** | `qiskit-addon-slc` | Shaded Lightcones for reducing PEC sampling overhead |\n"
msgstr ""
"| Addon | Pakiet | Opis |\n"
"|-------|---------|-------------|\n"
"| **Circuit Cutting** | `qiskit-addon-cutting` | Zmniejsz szerokość i głębokość Circuit przez cięcie Gate i połączeń |\n"
"| **SQD** | `qiskit-addon-sqd` | Sample-based Quantum Diagonalization do szacowania stanu podstawowego |\n"
"| **OBP** | `qiskit-addon-obp` | Operator Back-Propagation w celu redukcji głębokości Circuit |\n"
"| **MPF** | `qiskit-addon-mpf` | Multi-Product Formulas dla ulepszonej symulacji Hamiltonian |\n"
"| **AQC-Tensor** | `qiskit-addon-aqc-tensor` | Approximate Quantum Compilation z sieciami tensorowymi |\n"
"| **PNA** | `qiskit-addon-pna` | Propagated Noise Absorption do łagodzenia błędów |\n"
"| **SLC** | `qiskit-addon-slc` | Shaded Lightcones do redukcji narzutu próbkowania PEC |\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"All tutorials can be executed directly in your browser using Binder, or on "
"your own Jupyter server.\n"
msgstr ""
"Wszystkie samouczki możesz uruchomić bezpośrednio w przeglądarce za pomocą "
"Binder lub na własnym serwerze Jupyter.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
